, European Mathematical Society (2009).","DOI":"10.4171\/068"},{"key":"9099_CR14","unstructured":"J. Luk and S.-J. Oh, Proof of linear instability of the Reissner-Nordstr\u00f6m Cauchy horizon under scalar perturbations, Duke Math. J. 166 (2017) 437 [arXiv:1501.04598] [INSPIRE]."},{"key":"9099_CR15","unstructured":"M. Dafermos and Y. Shlapentokh-Rothman, Time-Translation Invariance of Scattering Maps and Blue-Shift Instabilities on Kerr Black Hole Spacetimes, Commun. Math. Phys. 350 (2017) 985 [arXiv:1512.08260] [INSPIRE]."},{"key":"9099_CR16","unstructured":"F. Mellor and I. Moss, Stability of Black Holes in de Sitter Space, Phys. Rev. D 41 (1990) 403 [INSPIRE]."},{"key":"9099_CR17","unstructured":"C.M. Chambers and I.G. Moss, Stability of the Cauchy horizon in Kerr-de Sitter space-times, Class. Quant. Grav. 11 (1994) 1035 [gr-qc\/9404015] [INSPIRE]."},{"key":"9099_CR18","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"P.R. Brady, I.G. Moss and R.C. Myers, Cosmic censorship: As strong as ever, Phys. Rev. Lett. 80 (1998) 3432 [gr-qc\/9801032] [INSPIRE].","DOI":"10.1103\/PhysRevLett.80.3432"},{"key":"9099_CR19","unstructured":"V. Cardoso, J.L. Costa, K. Destounis, P. Hintz and A. Jansen, Quasinormal modes and Strong Cosmic Censorship, Phys. Rev. Lett. 120 (2018) 031103 [arXiv:1711.10502] [INSPIRE]."},{"key":"9099_CR20","unstructured":"P. Hintz and A. Vasy, The global non-linear stability of the Kerr-de Sitter family of black holes, arXiv:1606.04014 [INSPIRE]."},{"key":"9099_CR21","unstructured":"P. Hintz, Non-linear stability of the Kerr-Newman-de Sitter family of charged black holes, arXiv:1612.04489 [INSPIRE]."},{"key":"9099_CR22","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"289","DOI":"10.1007\/s00220-018-3122-z","volume":"361","author":"JL Costa","year":"2018","unstructured":"J.L. Costa, P.M. Gir\u00e3o, J. Nat\u00e1rio and J.D. Silva, On the Occurrence of Mass Inflation for the Einstein-Maxwell-Scalar Field System with a Cosmological Constant and an Exponential Price